<title>UK: Portugal's BFB sets $100 mln perp step-up FRN, call.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BFB sets $100 mln perp step-up FRN, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers J.P. Morgan and Caixa Geral de Depositos SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO FONSECAS &amp; BURNAY  (BFB)</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	SPREAD    *+70 BP    MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE   PERP FRN	BASE	*3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.785    FULL FEES   0.625 PCT</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  A+	  REOFFER    99.785</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED PERPETUAL UPPER TIER 2 CAPITAL</p>
<p>		*CALL AFTER FIVE YEARS, IF NOT CALLED STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		3ML +220 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/PT/CY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (1)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
